---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Setup — Flávio Dutra">
  <div class="wrap content page">
    <p class="prompt">
      ~/setup <span>$</span> cat setup.md
    </p>
    <h1>
      Meu setup<span class="accent">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p>Um olhar sobre a máquina e as ferramentas que uso para desenvolver.</p>
    <section>
      <h2>Máquina</h2>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Processador</th>
            <td>AMD Ryzen 7 5700X3D</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Placa de vídeo</th>
            <td>NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (8 GB)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Memória</th>
            <td>16 GB RAM</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Armazenamento</th>
            <td>512 GB</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Ambiente de desenvolvimento</th>
            <td>Ubuntu 26.04 LTS on WSL2</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Ferramentas e dotfiles</h2>
      <p>
        Minha configuração inclui Fish, Neovim e Starship. Você pode conhecê-la
        no meu{" "}
        <a class="inline" href="https://github.com/flaviomdutra/dotfiles">
          repositório de dotfiles ↗
        </a>
        .
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
